				<r3d:remarks>As part of the Energy Resources Conservation Board, Alberta Geological Survey (AGS) provides geological information and expertise to government, industry and the public about Alberta’s resources and geological processes. This information helps manage and develop our resources. Contains the &#039;Geological Atlas of the Western Canada Sedimentary Basin&#039;.
The digital data sets are packaged in a ZIP archive file format. In addition, selected data are available through the AGS Open Data Portal in spreadsheet, shapefile, or KML format.</r3d:remarks>
